⚡️🤖 OpenAI has unveiled GPT-6 Astra, featuring a massive 1.05-million-token context window and significantly expanded computer-use capabilities. Astra can directly access and navigate websites and software interfaces, interacting with them to complete multi-step tasks, a shift from AI primarily generating instructions and content toward models increasingly capable of acting through the same interfaces humans use.

Astra also marks a major jump in cybersecurity capabilities, becoming OpenAI's first model to reach its Critical cyber capability threshold. During evaluations, it reportedly demonstrated the ability to independently discover previously unknown vulnerabilities and develop working exploits, including finding two zero-day vulnerabilities, prompting additional safeguards around access to its most advanced cyber capabilities.

